  "body": "Auction: 8-12 The Promenade, Takapuna on Wednesday 9 December 2026 at 9:30AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nPositioned in sought-after Rothesay Bay, just moments from beautiful beaches, coastal reserves and the popular Browns Bay village, this beautifully presented home offers the space, flexibility and relaxed lifestyle that make the North Shore such a great place to live. With sweeping Hauraki Gulf views, a sunny north-facing aspect and accommodation spread over two levels, walking distance to Browns Bay School and zoning for Northcross Intermediate, Murrays Bay Intermediate and Rangitoto College, there is plenty here for families to enjoy.\r\n\r\nSet on a 400m2 freehold site, the layout provides excellent flexibility for families of all ages. The ground floor offers two bedrooms, a separate living area, rumpus room, study, bathroom and laundry, together with a single garage. This versatile space lends itself perfectly to teenagers, extended family, guests or those wanting a little separation between living and working.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, three further bedrooms are complemented by a family bathroom and expansive living, dining, hosted by a modern, well-equipped kitchen. Filled with natural light, the living spaces open out to a substantial deck, where the sweeping Gulf views create a wonderful setting for entertaining and relaxing. North-facing and bathed in sunshine throughout the day, it's an inviting spot to enjoy everything from morning coffee to long summer evenings.\r\n\r\nWith loads of space, wonderful views and a coastal lifestyle that's hard to beat, this is North Shore living at its very best. We’d love to see you at the open home.",
